  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed outbuilding, by reason of its excessive size, bulk, and massing within the highly visible plot, would appear as an unduly dominant and disproportionate form of development that would fail to remain subordinate to the host dwelling. The development would erode the open and spacious character of the site and be visually intrusive within the street scene. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy BE1 of the Hillingdon Local Plan: Part One Strategic Policies (2012), and Policies DMHB 11 and DMHD 2 of the Hillingdon Local Plan: Part Two Development Management Policies (2020)."
